.env
physlean-extract/output/math_corpus_full.json
# Generated artifacts produced by `just extract-physlean` /
# `just extract-mathlib`. The full `+all` math_corpus is ~290 MB which
# exceeds GitHub's pre-receive size check; the catalog is ~12 MB. Both
# regenerate from upstream PhysLean + Mathlib HEAD via
# `just refresh-corpus`. Local dev: `just bootstrap` after cloning.
# Deploy: `deploy/scripts/build-release.sh` auto-refreshes via its
# freshness gate (STALE_AFTER_DAYS=14 default) and bakes them into the
# tarball, so prod boot finds them at /opt/nasrudin/physlean-extract/output/.
physlean-extract/output/math_corpus.json
physlean-extract/output/catalog.json
backups/

# Playwright MCP scratch + per-session UX audit screenshots
.playwright-mcp/
audit-*.png
